{"file":"WhatBreaks-0.1.0-v1.zip","bytes":207021,"status":"已读取","plugins":[{"path":".claude-plugin/plugin.json","name":"whatbreaks","displayName":"WhatBreaks","description":"Reviews a Terraform, OpenTofu, or Terragrunt plan before you apply it: what is destroyed or replaced (and whether data is lost), what opens to the internet, which protections or IAM limits are loosened, ranked by severity with a fix for each. Bundled offline analyzer; nothing leaves your machine. In Claude Code and Cowork an apply gate refuses terraform apply until that exact plan file has been reviewed.","version":"0.1.0","license":"MIT","repository":"https://github.com/njrkay/whatbreaks","homepage":"https://github.com/njrkay/whatbreaks","keywords":["terraform","opentofu","terragrunt","infrastructure-as-code","iac","plan-review","blast-radius","security","devops","sre","aws","gcp","azure","kubernetes","helm","terraform-plan"]}],"skills":[{"path":"skills/approve/SKILL.md","name":"approve","description":"Records the user's explicit decision to apply a plan whose review verdict was BLOCK, so the whatbreaks apply gate lets `terraform apply <plan-file>` through; `--revoke` removes it. Runs only when the user types /whatbreaks:approve. Never invoke this on your own initiative, to get past the apply gate, or because a plan looks fine.","headings":["Approve a blocked plan for apply","Before recording an approval","Record it","Revoke","Where this works"],"name_hint":"approve","description_zh":"仅用户明确运行whatbreaks:approve时记录对BLOCK计划的执行决定，使terraform apply门禁放行，可用revoke撤销；不自行批准或绕过审查。"},{"path":"skills/review/SKILL.md","name":"review","description":"Risk review of a Terraform, OpenTofu, or Terragrunt plan before apply: what the apply will destroy, replace, expose to the internet, or weaken (deletion protection, backups, IAM), ranked by severity with a fix for each finding, using a bundled deterministic analyzer. Use when the user shares a plan as `terraform show -json` JSON (pasted or uploaded; it has `resource_changes`) or pasted `terraform plan` text (`Plan: N to add, N to change, N to destroy`, `must be replaced`, `forces replacement`), asks whether a plan is safe to apply, what it will do or what breaks, why a resource is being replaced or destroyed, or asks you to run `terraform apply` / `tofu apply` / `terragrunt apply` (review first). Not for writing or refactoring HCL, provider documentation questions, or init/validate/state-lock errors with no plan involved.","headings":["Review a Terraform / OpenTofu plan","1. Get the plan as JSON","2. Run the analyzer","3. Write the review","4. Sensitive data","References"],"name_hint":"评审","description_zh":"执行前用确定性分析器审查Terraform、OpenTofu或Terragrunt计划的销毁替换、公开暴露及删除保护、备份、IAM弱化，按严重性给修复；支持plan文本或带resource_changes的JSON，不用于无计划的HCL或锁错误。"}],"commands":[],"readmes":[{"path":"README.md","headings":["WhatBreaks","What it does","What the analyzer looks for","Install","Use it","How the apply gate works, and its limits","What the plugin reads, runs, writes, and sends","Test it","Troubleshooting","Security and contact","License"]},{"path":"evals/README.md","headings":["Eval suite"]}],"mcp_servers":[],"config_names":["apply_gate"],"paths":[".claude-plugin/icon.svg",".claude-plugin/plugin.json",".github/workflows/test.yml",".gitignore","CHANGELOG.md","LICENSE","PRIVACY.md","README.md","evals/README.md","evals/azure-nsg-any/case.yaml","evals/azure-nsg-any/graders/fix-suggested.md","evals/azure-nsg-any/graders/resource-named.md","evals/azure-nsg-any/graders/rubric.md","evals/azure-nsg-any/graders/skill-fired.md","evals/azure-nsg-any/graders/verdict.md","evals/azure-nsg-any/prompt.md","evals/azure-nsg-any/resources/plan.json","evals/clean-plan/case.yaml","evals/clean-plan/graders/no-false-alarm.md","evals/clean-plan/graders/resource-named.md","evals/clean-plan/graders/rubric.md","evals/clean-plan/graders/skill-fired.md","evals/clean-plan/graders/verdict.md","evals/clean-plan/prompt.md","evals/clean-plan/resources/plan.json","evals/count-shift/cas